; rename.eval — renaming a dungeon and a level reaches everything that names
; them (W11), in the world renamesetup.eval built. NO savemap here on purpose:
; WorldTest reads the files straight after, because a rename moves files on
; disk at once, and everything pointing at them has to be on disk at once too.
logecho on
reset
validate
dungeons rename keep castle
dungeons
worldloc
worldprops
validate
levelrename room1 hall
dungeons
worldloc
worldprops
validate
; Refusals: a stem that is not a file name, a level that does not exist, and
; one already taken.
levelrename hall ha/ll
levelrename nosuch other
levelrename hall keep1
